lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">比亚迪发布首颗车规级4nm智驾芯片璇玑A3，算力对齐英伟达Thor</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">宇树科技将于6月1日科创板IPO上会，冲刺人形机器人与具身智能第一股</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI向日本核心金融机构开放GPT-5.5 Cyber模型以应对AI网络攻击</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">软银投资750亿欧元在法国建设超级算力中心，联手OpenAI布局欧洲</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/93eaeaa7ae90ee3c4f6fe460b583fd18.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">软银集团于5月30日宣布，计划投入750亿欧元在法国建设大规模数据中心集群，这是软银在欧洲规模最大的人工智能基础设施投资。该项目目标是开发并运营总计5吉瓦（GW）的附加数据中心容量，第一阶段将重点在法国北部的敦刻尔克、博斯凯及布尚三地建设，预计在2031年前为上法兰西大区提供3.1吉瓦的算力支撑。作为OpenAI的核心投资方与深度客户，软银此举旨在通过卡位电力设施完备的区域，满足AI模型训练与推理的指数级算力需求。法国经济部部长罗兰·莱斯屈尔表示，该投资将助力法国进入全球AI价值链核心。尽管全球范围内数据中心建设面临环境与电网负荷的审视，软银仍持续推进其全球算力布局，此前已在美国俄亥俄州规划建设由9.2吉瓦天然气发电厂供电的数据中心。此次重仓法国标志着顶级科技资本与地缘政治的深度结合，将直接重塑欧洲的AI算力版</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达联手微软与ARM发布自研PC芯片N1X，将于Computex正式亮相</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达、微软与ARM近日同步发布预告，确认将于5月28日在Computex期间揭晓自研PC芯片N1X。该芯片由英伟达与联发科联合研发，采用台积电N3B制程，集成20核ARM架构CPU及拥有6144个CUDA核心的Blackwell架构GPU。N1X采用统一内存架构，配备128GB LPDDR5X内存，带宽预计达273GB/s。尽管运行x86游戏需经模拟转译，但其核心定位在于AI原生计算。N1X旨在实现大模型本地化部署，降低用户调用AI算力的成本，使开发者与创作者能以近乎零边际成本生产Token。此举标志着Windows on Arm阵营正式向苹果M系列芯片发起挑战，通过算力下沉打破AI基础设施垄断，推动个人终端进入AI原生计算新纪元。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">比亚迪发布首颗车规级4nm智驾芯片璇玑A3，算力对齐英伟达Thor</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c9ab42302eef436f7387cb11e089f78f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月29日，比亚迪正式发布首颗全链路自研的车规级4nm智驾芯片“璇玑A3”，标志着国产车载AI计算芯片进入全球第一梯队。该芯片采用16核CPU，算力达420K DMIPS，内存带宽为273GB/s，三颗芯片组合理论峰值算力超2100TOPS。与英伟达通用GPU架构不同，璇玑A3采用专用NPU架构，将AI算子硬件化，使单位算力功耗降低20%，算法资源利用率提升一倍。比亚迪承诺，搭载璇玑A3的车辆在城市领航期间若发生辅助驾驶事故，平台将全额赔付经济损失且不设上限。目前比亚迪拥有7000人芯片研发团队及5座晶圆厂，此次发布不仅为L3/L4级自动驾驶完成硬件卡位，也为具身智能提供了物理AI平台底座，进一步强化了其从电池、电控到智驾芯片的全链路自研闭环能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">宇树科技将于6月1日科创板IPO上会，冲刺人形机器人与具身智能第一股</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b97ef577a3d3e3e74954819deac5e137.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">杭州宇树科技股份有限公司将于6月1日正式迎来科创板IPO首发审议，成为本周3家上会企业之一，旨在冲击人形机器人与具身智能第一股。宇树科技专注于高性能通用人形机器人、四足机器人、机器人组件及具身智能模型的研发、生产与销售，在全球范围内率先实现了高性能四足机器人的公开销售与行业落地，其相关产品销量持续保持全球领先。此次IPO不仅是宇树科技商业化提速的关键节点，也标志着AI与物理世界深度融合的硬件载体正式加速驶入资本快车道。随着大模型技术持续赋能机器人的交互与控制，宇树科技若成功上市，将为具身智能产业的规模化落地提供充裕的资金与生态支持，并有望进一步重塑全球机器人产业链的供给格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI向日本核心金融机构开放GPT-5.5 Cyber模型以应对AI网络攻击</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8bab4103eedbea4b33ba872db755b5ef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI已正式向日本核心金融机构开放最新GPT-5.5 Cyber模型的使用权限，旨在通过部署防御型AI模型提升日本金融体系的网络攻防与抗风险能力。该决策系日美政府协商后的重要成果，旨在应对由高阶AI模型带来的网络安全威胁。首批获准接入该模型的机构包括三菱日联银行、三井住友银行与瑞穗银行。此外，日本政府计划后续引入Anthropic旗下的Claude Mythos模型，通过多模型协同作战，构筑政企联合的网络安全防线。此次合作标志着日本金融行业正式引入顶尖AI技术进行防御升级，以应对黑客利用AI排查漏洞及实施恶意攻击的新型挑战。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
